            {
              "_key": "000000000000",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "The Colored Canyon"
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "h2"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000007",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000002",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "strong"
              ],
              "text": "Introduction: A Journey on Foot or Wheel"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000003",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " "
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000005",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "000000000004"
              ],
              "text": "The Colored Canyon"
            },
            {
              "_key": "hf9ng6tx0ntg",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": ", a breathtaking spectacle of nature, lies approximately 90km north of "
            },
            {
              "_key": "rqjj3uenhtlf",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "1m23nf039s1i"
              ],
              "text": "Dahab"
            },
            {
              "_key": "nwdcxske7895",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": ". Whether you choose to explore its wonders on foot or by vehicle, this natural marvel stands as a testament to the earth’s artistic prowess."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000004",
              "_type": "externalLink",
              "href": "https://www.egypttoday.com/Article/6/30303/The-Colored-canyon-in-Nuweiba-is-a-real-natural-wonder",
              "newTab": true
            },
            {
              "_key": "1m23nf039s1i",
              "_type": "internalLink",
              "reference": {
                "_ref": "wp-page-59436",
                "_type": "reference"
              }
            }
          ],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "00000000000d",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000008",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "strong"
              ],
              "text": "A Palette of Natural Hues"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000009",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " Traversing "
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000000b",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "00000000000a"
              ],
              "text": "the Colored Canyon"
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000000c",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": ", one can’t help but marvel at the natural interplay of colors that adorns its walls. It’s almost implausible to believe that these vibrant hues and intricate patterns weren’t crafted by the hands of a master artist. The canyon’s beauty is further enhanced by the harmonious blend of background colors, creating a visual symphony that captivates the senses."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [
            {
              "_key": "00000000000a",
              "_pendingInternalRef": {
                "sourceLocale": "en",
                "wpUrl": "https://travel2egypt.org/cairo-travel-guide/the-khayrbek-complex/"
              },
              "_type": "externalLink",
              "href": "/guide/cairo/khayrbek-complex",
              "newTab": false
            }
          ],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000010",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "00000000000e",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "strong"
              ],
              "text": "Guided Explorations with Bedouin Wisdom"
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000000f",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " In this natural gallery, visitors have the opportunity to be guided by native Bedouin tour guides. These local custodians of the canyon offer a choice of exploration on foot or the traditional camelback. As you journey through the canyon, these guides enrich the experience with tales of the area’s history, folklore, and insights into significant features that might otherwise go unnoticed by the solitary traveler."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000013",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000011",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "strong"
              ],
              "text": "Safari Adventures from Dahab"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000012",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " For those seeking a more adrenaline-fueled exploration, safaris in all-terrain 4-wheel-drive vehicles are available from Dahab. These excursions not only cover the Colored Canyon but also include major stopovers at Jebel El Tih, Jebel Serbi, and Serabit El Khadem, each offering its unique landscape and story."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000015",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000014",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "The Colored Canyon is not just a destination; it’s an immersive experience in nature’s artistry. With each step or turn of the wheel, visitors are invited to witness a landscape that defies the imagination, a place where nature’s palette unveils its most stunning creations."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000016",
          "_pendingImage": "https://travel2egypt.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/56.jpg",
